{"text":"Im Workbook findest du Übung 2.1: Meine Bewegungs-Anamnese. Eine kurze Bestandsaufnahme: Was bewegst du aktuell schon? Was würdest du gerne wieder können? Welche Bewegungen meidest du, und seit wann? Bevor du in Lektion 2.2 weitergehst, hol dir bitte das, was du dafür brauchst: eine ruhige Ecke, eine Yogamatte oder Decke auf dem Boden, bequeme Kleidung, ein Kissen für unter den Kopf. Eine Massagerolle ist hilfreich, aber nicht zwingend – wir kommen darauf zurück. Dann sehen wir uns auf der Matte.","chars":["I","m"," ","W","o","r","k","b","o","o","k"," ","f","i","n","d","e","s","t"," ","d","u"," ","Ü","b","u","n","g"," ","2",".","1",":"," ","M","e","i","n","e"," ","B","e","w","e","g","u","n","g","s","-","A","n","a","m","n","e","s","e","."," ","E","i","n","e"," ","k","u","r","z","e"," ","B","e","s","t","a","n","d","s","a","u","f","n","a","h","m","e",":"," ","W","a","s"," ","b","e","w","e","g","s","t"," ","d","u"," ","a","k","t","u","e","l","l"," ","s","c","h","o","n","?"," ","W","a","s"," ","w","ü","r","d","e","s","t"," ","d","u"," ","g","e","r","n","e"," ","w","i","e","d","e","r"," ","k","ö","n","n","e","n","?"," ","W","e","l","c","h","e"," ","B","e","w","e","g","u","n","g","e","n"," ","m","e","i","d","e","s","t"," ","d","u",","," ","u","n","d"," ","s","e","i","t"," ","w","a","n","n","?"," ","B","e","v","o","r"," ","d","u"," ","i","n"," ","L","e","k","t","i","o","n"," ","2",".","2"," ","w","e","i","t","e","r","g","e","h","s","t",","," ","h","o","l"," ","d","i","r"," ","b","i","t","t","e"," ","d","a","s",","," ","w","a","s"," ","d","u"," ","d","a","f","ü","r"," ","b","r","a","u","c","h","s","t",":"," ","e","i","n","e"," ","r","u","h","i","g","e"," ","E","c","k","e",","," ","e","i","n","e"," ","Y","o","g","a","m","a","t","t","e"," ","o","d","e","r"," ","D","e","c","k","e"," ","a","u","f"," ","d","e","m"," ","B","o","d","e","n",","," ","b","e","q","u","e","m","e"," ","K","l","e","i","d","u","n","g",","," ","e","i","n"," ","K","i","s","s","e","n"," ","f","ü","r"